                            <comment id="495045" author="sebastien" created="Tue, 26 May 2026 15:25:59 +0000">&lt;p&gt;Hi &lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=scadmin" class="user-hover" rel="scadmin"&gt;scadmin&lt;/a&gt;, thanks for sharing this. I think the idea would be for you to have a Gerrit account (&lt;a href="https://review.whamcloud.com" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://review.whamcloud.com&lt;/a&gt;) and push this patch so that it can be reviewed and later merged into master. Please make sure you read the Coding Style Guidelines and Submitting Changes dedicated wiki pages:&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;a href="https://wiki.lustre.org/Lustre_Coding_Style_Guidelines" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://wiki.lustre.org/Lustre_Coding_Style_Guidelines&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;a href="https://wiki.lustre.org/Submitting_Changes" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://wiki.lustre.org/Submitting_Changes&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="493630" author="scadmin" created="Fri, 24 Apr 2026 03:42:17 +0000">&lt;p&gt;the functionality to allow only a privileged group or users to use lfs setstripe, PFL, etc. is incomplete in master and b2_15.&lt;br/&gt;
currently there are multiple ways available to users to still set striping.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;the patch I made for master and b2_15 is basically the same.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;(edit - concerns related to unrelated lbug removed)&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;cheers,&lt;br/&gt;
robin&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="493261" author="green" created="Fri, 17 Apr 2026 17:15:58 +0000">&lt;p&gt;Do you mean the current master codebase does not cover the code paths adequately? Or just in b2_15 branch?&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;If you ar using a modified patch, consider uploading it to gerrit for review?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
